Returns the total tile count for the TIFF, using tile size and image dimensions; if tile dims are unset (-1), it falls back to full image size. Use after directory setup. Returns 0 if any tile dim is 0; multiplies by samples/pixel for PLANARCONFIG_SEPARATE.
