# Information about `LogLuv32toXYZ`

## Function Signature

```c

extern void LogLuv32toXYZ(uint32_t, float*);
```

## Source Code

```c
void LogLuv32toXYZ(uint32_t p, float XYZ[3]) {
  double L, u, v, s, x, y;
  /* decode luminance */
  L = LogL16toY((int)p >> 16);
  if (L <= 0.) {
    XYZ[0] = XYZ[1] = XYZ[2] = 0.;
    return;
  }
  /* decode color */
  u = 1. / UVSCALE * ((p >> 8 & 0xff) + .5);
  v = 1. / UVSCALE * ((p & 0xff) + .5);
  s = 1. / (6. * u - 16. * v + 12.);
  x = 9. * u * s;
  y = 4. * v * s;
  /* convert to XYZ */
  XYZ[0] = (float)(x / y * L);
  XYZ[1] = (float)L;
  XYZ[2] = (float)((1. - x - y) / y * L);
}
```

