Response for query 328 after 0.86s:
Sets the read buffer for a TIFF, replacing any existing raw buffer and disabling mmap use. If `bp` is given, it uses caller memory; otherwise it allocates/zeros a rounded-up buffer and owns it. Returns 0 on invalid size, else success.
