24. `_TIFFmemset`
    `_TIFFmemset` is a thin libtiff wrapper around `memset`. Use it to fill `c` bytes at `p` with byte value `v`. It behaves like `memset`; `c` is cast to `size_t`, so it performs no extra checks or special handling. Its signature is:
