    Reads a TIFF into an RGBA raster with a requested orientation. Call after `TIFFRGBAImageOK`; it initializes via `TIFFRGBAImageBegin`, fills `raster` starting at `raster + (rheight-img.height)*rwidth`, then ends. On unsupported/failed init it reports an error and returns 0. Its signature is:
