​ Purpose: read one strile from caller-supplied raw buffer, using it as TIFF raw data. Use only on readable TIFFs and when raw uncompressed access is supported. It temporarily swaps tif raw buffer state; returns 0 on error, 1 on success.
​ Its signature is:
​ ```c
extern int TIFFReadFromUserBuffer(TIFF* tif, uint32_t strile,
 void* inbuf, tmsize_t insize,
