​ ```
2. `TIFFGetReadProc`
​ `TIFFGetReadProc` returns the current read callback stored in a `TIFF*`. Use it to inspect the I/O read function attached to a TIFF handle. It does not read data or modify state; it simply returns `tif->tif_readproc` (or whatever callback is currently set).
