4. `TIFFSetClientdata`
​ `TIFFSetClientdata` sets `tif->tif_clientdata` to `newvalue` and returns the previous value. Use it to replace the TIFF handle’s client-data pointer; it has no validation or side effects beyond the assignment.
​ Its signature is:
